  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: " Environmental responsibility is essential in gold prospecting. Prospectors
    must avoid damaging waterways, disturbing wildlife habitats, or leaving trash
    behind. Many follow \u201Cleave no trace\u201D principles to minimize their impact.
    Some areas require special permits to ensure responsible mining practices and
    protect local ecosystems. Sustainable prospecting ensures that natural areas
    remain preserved for future generations.\n\n Gold prospecting continues to attract
    hobbyists and professionals alike due to its blend of challenge and excitement.
    Whether searching in a river with a pan or exploring old mines with advanced
    equipment, the thrill of discovery keeps people engaged. Even small finds can
    be rewarding, offering a sense of accomplishment and connection to the earth.
    Over time, prospectors develop valuable knowledge about nature, geology, and
    outdoor skills. Ultimately, gold prospecting is as much about the journey as
    it is about the treasure."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
